        'Planned load check: compute the total volume, total weight and the corresponding utilization for the planned piece count; exceeding the volume limit is flagged as over volume, exceeding the weight limit as overloaded, and utilization above 90% as nearly full — used to review before departure whether an extra vehicle is needed or the load must be reduced.',
